<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia skilled vacancies rise in Feb-govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia skilled vacancies rise in Feb-govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Government's skilled vacancies index rose 0.7 percent in February from January and was 9.3 percent lower than a year earlier, the Employment Department said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
